    "full_details": "Notices\nA Hunting Event for up to 30 guild members! The Guild Floor Boss Hunting Event \"Floor Boss Battle VS Taurus King\" is here!\nEVENT\n2021-09-08 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Guild Floor Boss Hunting Event \"Floor Boss Battle VS Taurus King\" is here. Fight the floor boss alongside your guild members!\nThis time, the 2F Floor Boss, \"\nAsterios the Taurus King\n\", appears as a dungeon Raid Boss who can be challenged by up to 30 guild members.\nTake on the boss using the combined strength of your guild members!\nRewards\nReceive \"2F Floor Boss Battle Badge\" by completing \"Entry\", \"Depth\", or \"Special\" difficulty.\nGather 40 of these to get the Limited Record \"2F Strategy Guild\" as an achievement reward.\nReceive \"Floor Boss Extreme Battle Badge\" by completing Extreme difficulty.\nGather 40 of these to get the Limited Record\n\"Refined Unity\"\nas an achievement reward.\nYou can get items like Medals of Unity, Awakening Star awakening materials, all kinds of Great Jewels, and Memoria Niter S from this event.\nEvery player will receive their own score and challenge rewards if they clear it.\nThere's a chance that Star Fragments will drop at \"Special\" and \"Extreme\" difficulties.\nRecord Background\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\n2F Strategy Guild\nLet's collect a total of 40 2F Floor Boss Battle Badges\nRevive Crystal×1\nRefined Unity\nLet's collect a total of 40 Floor Boss Extreme Battle Badges\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Raid Boss Dungeon\" NPC in the \"Guild Room\" to challenge the dungeon.\nTalk to the \"Guild Room Guide\" NPC in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to go to your \"Guild Room\".\nEvent Period\nStarts after the September 8, 2021 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 29, 2021 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\n‧Must be a member of a guild.\n‧Complete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nGuilds\nGuilds can be created and joined through the \"Guild Counter\" NPC.\nYou can gain the benefits of Guild Skills that will help in your journeys, such as increased item drop rates and increased Weapon Proficiency acquisition by joining a guild and increasing its Guild Level.\nThe Guild Raid buff acquirable from Guild Level 16 is useful for challenging Raid Boss Dungeons.\nPlayers who do not belong to a guild should use this opportunity to join one!\nPlease see below for more details on guilds.\nCreating a Guild\nGuild Skills\nBoss Monster\nAsterios the Taurus King\nDetails\nAppears after you defeat the two bosses, Baran the General Taurus and Nato the Colonel Taurus.\nIts attacks can inflict Paralysis or debuffs that decrease defense.\nWhen its HP falls below a certain amount, it gains a buff that increases its attack.\nChallenge its Chaos Recollection damage-reduction buff on \"Special\" and \"Extreme\" difficulties by equipping an Awakening Skill.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nWater Element\nResistance\nPoison\nFrostbite\nBurn\nBleed\nWind Element\nSpecial items that can be received from Score Rewards\nEntry\nDepth\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n2400\nGreat Red Jewel\n1\n12480\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n2550\nGreat Green Jewel\n1\n13260\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n2700\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n1\n14040\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n2850\nGreat Blue Jewel\n1\n14820\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n3000\nAwakening Star\n5\n15600\nAwakening Star\n5\n3450\nMedal of Unity\n2\n17940\nMedal of Unity\n3\n3750\nAwakening Star\n5\n19500\nAwakening Star\n5\nSpecial\nExtreme\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n6450\nGreat Red Jewel\n1\n5900\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n7740\nGreat Green Jewel\n1\n7080\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n9030\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n1\n8260\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n10320\nGreat Blue Jewel\n1\n9440\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n11610\nAwakening Star\n5\n10620\nAwakening Star\n5\n20640\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n24780\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n23220\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n25960\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n25800\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n28320\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n27090\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n31860\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n28380\nAwakening Star\n5\n35400\nAwakening Star\n5\n38700\nMedal of Unity\n5\n38940\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n42570\nAwakening Star\n5\n54280\nAwakening Star\n5\n46440\nMemoria Niter S\n1\n59000\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n54180\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n88500\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n64500\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n106200\nMemoria Niter S\n2\nー\nー\nー\n123900\nMemoria Niter S\n2\nー\nー\nー\n177000\nMemoria Niter S\n2\nー\nー\nー\n236000\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n* Please check all Score Rewards in the game.\nChallenge Rewards\n·Entry\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies (Able to achieve repeatedly)\n2F Floor Boss Battle Badge\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nRecord Frame M\n10\nCompleted within 2 minutes\nGlare Rigid Stone\n5\n·Depth\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies (Able to achieve repeatedly)\n2F Floor Boss Battle Badge\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nRestorative Potion\n5\nCompleted within 5 minutes\nRevive Crystal\n1\n·Special\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies (Able to achieve repeatedly)\n2F Floor Boss Battle Badge\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nRecord Frame L\n5\nCompleted within 7 minutes\nCleansing Potion\n10\n·Extreme\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nFloor Boss Extreme Battle Badge\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nLife Potion\n10\nCompleted within 12 minutes\nRelease Crystal (M)\n5\nImportant\n‧Raid Boss Tickets are not required to challenge the Raid Boss.\n‧Guild members who challenge the Raid Boss will not be able to challenge other \"Raid Bosses\" until they clear or finish their current dungeon.\n‧The boss \"Asterios the Taurus King\" is different from the one that appears in the Main Quest.\n·The damage-increasing effect of the Awakening Skill is not negated by Chaos Recollection.\n‧2F Floor Boss Battle Badges and Floor Boss Extreme Battle Badges will be deleted on October 6, 2021 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n·The quest schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\n18th \"Guild of Guilds\" Announcement\nThe \"Guild of Guilds\" Event where you can fight alongside your guild members is planned to start on September 29, 2021 (Wed) (JST/UTC+9).\nThe appearing boss \"Masquerade Demon\" will be weak to the natural element \"Dark\" and the weapon element \"Thrust\".\nIn addition, the \"Guild of Guilds\" Ranking Event is scheduled to begin on October 6, 2021 (Wed) (JST/UTC+9). It will be a High Score Ranking, where guilds compete for ranks based on their high scores.\nGo to Notice List",
