    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Resplendent Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2021-09-08 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNew ★4 Skill Records with Kirito in a black martial arts uniform, and Silica, Yuuki, and Koharu in Chinese dresses are here!\nThe \"\nResplendent Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Muei Zessho] Yuuki\nweapon type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nStorm Orbit\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill effect\n660% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Gale Demon 4/Buff] Wind element damage +55% for 8 sec./[Wind Element Weak 4/Debuff] Wind element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Dragon Cat] Silica\nweapon type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nWater Slice\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill effect\n1250% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Weak Defense 4/Debuff] Enemy defense -30% for 10 sec./\n▲[Bonus] Increase status ailment stacks by 5 on enemies when hitting poisoned enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n［During Rush］ Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Black Martial Arts] Kirito\nSkill Name\nEarth's Indemnity/Enhance Antidote/Break Attack\nAttack\n51\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2800\nSkill effect\n[Earth's Indemnity 3] When you are poisoned, earth element damage +40%/[Enhance Antidote 3] Poison damage -30%./[Break Attack 3] Attack +25% to enemies when using break.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n［During Rush］ Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Tiny Qipao] Koharu\nweapon type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWind Nova\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill effect\n1250% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/\n▲[Bonus] Attack +800 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] Critical damage +30%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n* Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n- Duration\nStarts after the September 8, 2021 Maintenance - September 29, 2021 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\n* All Steps are 11 Orders.\n* The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\n* After Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\n* Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
